Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Possible applications inspire a great deal of curiosity\NOne is studying quantum systems
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,such as certain molecules and materials using\Nappropriate models and algorithms There is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,research in optimization communication and sensors But\Nthe word quantum does not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,guarantee a better solution To discuss an advantage we\Nneed to compare methods costs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,accuracy and execution conditions Some problems will\Nremain more suitable for classical
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,computers Others may benefit from approaches that\Ncombine classical and quantum tools In
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,this adventure we learn concepts we do not demonstrate a\Ncomputational advantage Making
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,that distinction is part of a good scientific\Nexplanation and it makes real discoveries
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,even more interesting